  section.section
    .container
      h1.page-title Terms of Use
      p.page-subtitle Last updated: March 2026

      .terms-content
        .terms-section
          h2 1. Acceptance of Terms
          p By accessing and using OutfitShare, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you should not use the platform. OutfitShare reserves the right to update these terms at any time, and continued use of the platform constitutes acceptance of any changes.

        .terms-section
          h2 2. User Accounts
          p You must provide accurate and complete information when creating an account. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your password and account. You must be at least 16 years of age to create an account. Each person may only maintain one account. OutfitShare reserves the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms.

        .terms-section
          h2 3. Listing Guidelines
          p All listings must accurately describe the item being shared, including size, condition, and availability. Images should represent the actual item. Prohibited items include counterfeit goods, items that infringe intellectual property rights, damaged or unsafe clothing, and any items that violate applicable laws. OutfitShare reserves the right to remove listings that do not meet these standards.

        .terms-section
          h2 4. Borrowing & Lending
          p Borrowers agree to return items in the same condition they were received, within the agreed timeframe. Lenders agree to provide items as described in their listings. Both parties should communicate clearly regarding pickup and return arrangements. OutfitShare facilitates connections between users but is not responsible for the condition, fit, or quality of shared items.

        .terms-section
          h2 5. Reviews & Ratings
          p Reviews must be honest, fair, and based on genuine transactions. Defamatory, abusive, or fraudulent reviews are prohibited. OutfitShare reserves the right to remove reviews that violate community guidelines. Users may not offer incentives in exchange for positive reviews.

        .terms-section
          h2 6. Reward Points & Boosting
          p Reward points are earned through platform activity and have no monetary value. Points can be used to boost listing visibility. OutfitShare reserves the right to modify the reward system at any time. Points cannot be transferred between accounts or exchanged for cash.

        .terms-section
          h2 7. Community Standards
          p Users are expected to treat each other with respect and courtesy. Harassment, discrimination, and abusive behaviour will not be tolerated. Users should report any concerns to the admin team. Violations of community standards may result in account suspension.

        .terms-section
          h2 8. Privacy & Data
          p OutfitShare collects and processes personal data as described in our privacy settings. Users can control the visibility of their personal information through the Settings page. We do not sell personal data to third parties. Profile information is used to facilitate the sharing experience and match users with suitable outfits.

        .terms-section
          h2 9. Limitation of Liability
          p OutfitShare is a platform that connects users for clothing sharing. We do not own, inspect, or guarantee any items listed on the platform. Users engage in transactions at their own risk. OutfitShare is not liable for any loss, damage, or injury arising from the use of shared items.

        .terms-section
          h2 10. Contact
          p If you have any questions about these Terms of Use, please contact us through our 
            a(href="/contact") contact page
            |  or email support@outfitshare.co.uk.
